{
  "id": "orings-fx",
  "name": "oRings FX",
  "abbrev": "oRNFX",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Audio FX built on the original open-source Rings DSP at its own 48 kHz: the incoming audio excites the modal resonator, sympathetic strings, inharmonic string, 2-op FM, Western Chords or Karplusverb (or runs through the Disastrous Peace effects), strummed by Rings' own onset detector, with an equal-power MIX",
